![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The variable `spin_timeout_ns` is unpacked from `params` but is not used anywhere within `all_reduce_impl`. This can trigger unused variable warnings or compilation errors depending on the compiler flags (e.g., `-Wunused-variable` or `-Werror`). Casting it to `void` suppresses this warning.

```
  const auto& [output, rank, num_items, spin_timeout_ns] = params;
  (void)spin_timeout_ns;
```

